,0.0,0.0],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"The terms agreed upon, you shake her soot-covered hand and you turn to head towards The Sea Ca t. But she's not the only one waiting for you. Captain Neckbeard stalks along on the footpath, with three of his skeleton pirates.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":11.84,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":42},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":11.84,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":42},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"\"Well done gathering a crew,\" Neckbeard says, clapping sarcastically. \"You were in such a rush to get those scurvy dogs together it seemed like a waste to race you. So, instead I think I'll take them, and your ship.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":12.256,"end":31.08,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":39},"large":{"start":12.256,"end":31.136,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":39},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"The dead men advance on you in a group. You could defeat one of them easily enough but even you can't take on three. Still, you draw your cutlass, only to feel a hand on your shoulder.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":31.68,"end":41.54,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"large":{"start":31.68,"end":41.536,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"It’s Freebooter Kate, her cannon loaded and a fuse lit. “Permission to fire Captain?”","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":41.856,"end":47.2,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":14},"large":{"start":41.856,"end":47.2,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":14},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[{"start":47.56,"end":49.46,"words":6,"text":"well what do you tell her"}],"large":[{"start":47.56,"end":49.36,"words":6,"text":"well what do you tell her"}]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92eb5f1d55_PC%20JM12.png"}